# Build output, and the AstraPlugins checkout the manifest crate is read from.
#
# `_deps/` is never committed: whichever way it is produced — `link-deps.sh`
# symlinks a sibling working copy, CI does an `actions/checkout` pinned by SHA —
# it is a copy of another repository, and a copy of another repository committed
# into this one is the fourth fork of `plugin.toml` that task 3.7 exists to
# prevent.
/target/
/_deps/
